            <p>thanks to <a href="https://www.buddhistgeeks.org/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Vince Horn</a> and again to <a href="https://www.jhourney.io/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Jhourney</a> for inspiration.</p>
